Google Maps and Mapbox
----------------------

This source-code repository includes downloader utilities that can request map
or satellite tiles from Google Maps Platform or Mapbox when users provide their
own credentials. Google Maps, Mapbox, and their associated imagery, tiles,
logos, trademarks, and attribution requirements remain governed by their
respective provider terms.

Prepared benchmark GeoTIFF scenes are available through SatNav-Scenes-v0.1:
https://huggingface.co/datasets/Eku127/SatNav-Scenes-v0.1
The dataset card describes access and use terms. Users can also generate local
GeoTIFFs through the downloader with their own imagery-provider credentials.
Imagery rights and attribution follow the applicable provider agreements.

Bundled Synthetic Example Map
-----------------------------

`applications/resources/map.tif` is generated from deterministic coordinate
formulas by `scripts/generate_synthetic_example_map.py`. It contains no
third-party map or satellite pixels and is dedicated to the public domain under
CC0 1.0. The georeferencing is retained only for compatibility with the bundled
example episodes; the synthetic visual features do not describe that place.

